{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">游嘉欣26日在社交平台上分享了一輯於墨西哥拍攝的度假夜景美照。今次她罕有地告別了過往一貫的青春少女路線，換上一襲黑色露背連身短裙，大方展現迷人曲線與成熟的女人味。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"983c402c-a0b6-44c4-8c4d-c098dde79308.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/20266RuoReTPgO1787886086.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"983c402c-a0b6-44c4-8c4d-c098dde79308.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">相中可見，該款連身裙採用了極具挑戰性的露背設計，僅靠精緻的珍珠吊帶來固定前後連接位置。這個破格的性感造型讓一眾網民感到眼前一亮，大家紛紛留言讚賞，直指「大露背超有女人味」，並驚嘆她「成熟了很多，不再是小妹妹了」。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"1fe3011e-4a81-4fc6-a772-c298c365fb91.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/20267dl5x9Fcuc1787886086.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"1fe3011e-4a81-4fc6-a772-c298c365fb91.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-29T03:18:55.802200+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":188,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}